0:{"buildId":"-cWzmSOyU1muirH5dfsk2","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Fix Landing Page Friction to Boost Facebook Ad Leads\",\"description\":\"High CTR, zero leads? Separate Meta ad delivery from post-click behaviour, then test message match, proof, friction, and tracking.\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#founder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-21\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-10\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/learning-centre/facebook-ads-no-leads\"},\"image\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/opengraph-image\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-fg transition-colors","children":"← Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent","children":"Meta Ads Leaks · Facebook Ads"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Fix Landing Page Friction to Boost Facebook Ad Leads"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"If your Meta ads generate clicks but leads do not materialise, trace the handoff from ad to page before changing either layer. Message mismatch, tracking gaps, offer fit, load time, and form friction can produce similar symptoms."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-facebook-ads-no-leads&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"data-editorial":"answer-first","className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Direct answer: inspect the ad-to-page handoff"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Confirm the click and lead events first. Then compare the ad's promise and creative with the first mobile viewport, check whether proof appears before the form, and review form starts versus completions. Those observations tell you which hypothesis to test; they do not make the page the cause by default."}],["$","aside",null,{"role":"note","aria-label":"Evidence boundary","className":"mt-5 rounded-xl border border-border px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Evidence boundary:"}]," channel and page analytics can locate a break in the journey, but they do not prove causality or rule out audience, offer, attribution, and follow-up effects. No audit or page change guarantees a lead outcome."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm","children":["$L3","$L4"]}]]}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc"]}]]}],null,"$Ld"]}],"isPartial":"$@e","staleTime":"$f","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L10","isPartial":"$@11","staleTime":"$f","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L12","isPartial":"$@13","staleTime":"